{"id":"n87559-2-7","stage":4,"title":"표기 · 标写","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87559-2-7-1","ko":"나는 영어 단어 받아쓰기가 너무 어려워.","zh":"我觉得英语单词听写实在太难了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영어","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단어","meaning":"单词，词汇","explanation":"단어：单词，词汇","readings":[{"term":"단어","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57287","senseId":"1","lemma":"단어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아쓰기가","meaning":"听写","explanation":"받아쓰기：听写；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"받아쓰기","audio":"/audio/23cbce5a14a822d14f1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56548","senseId":"1","lemma":"받아쓰기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려워.","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"bc97e79178e9c607","term":"단어"